{
  "info": {
    "name": "CardPro AI — Auth Service",
    "description": "Complete Postman collection for the CardPro AI auth-service.\n\n## 🔐 Authentication Flow\n\n1. **Register** a new user or **Login** with existing credentials\n2. The `token` variable is automatically set via Postman test scripts\n3. Use **Refresh Token** when the access token expires\n4. Use **Logout** to invalidate the session\n\n## 📋 Prerequisites\n\nSet the following environment variables:\n\n| Variable | Description | Default |\n|---|---|---|\n| `base_url` | API Gateway URL | `http://localhost:8765` |\n| `token` | JWT access token (auto-set) | (empty) |\n| `refresh_token` | JWT refresh token (auto-set) | (empty) |\n| `user_id` | Logged-in user ID (auto-set) | (empty) |\n\n## 🔗 Related Collections\n\n- [Card Profiles API](./CardPro-AI-API.postman_collection.json)\n\n---\n\n*Generated for CardPro AI v1.0.0*",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "\uD83D\uDD10 Authentication",
      "description": "Authentication endpoints \u2014 all public (no JWT required).\n\n| Endpoint | Method | Description |\n|---|---|---|\n| `/auth/register` | POST | Create a new account |\n| `/auth/login` | POST | Sign in \u2192 get JWT tokens |\n| `/auth/refresh` | POST | Rotate expired access token |\n| `/auth/logout` | POST | Invalidate session |",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "\uD83D\uDCDD Register",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"newuser@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"SecurePass123!\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "register"]
            },
            "description": "Create a new user account.\n\n**Validation Rules:**\n- `email` \u2014 must be a valid email format\n- `password` \u2014 must be 8\u2013100 characters\n\n**Rate Limit:** 5 requests/minute/IP"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "201 Created \u2014 Registration Successful",
              "status": "Created",
              "code": 201,
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"status\": \"success\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"token\": \"eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9...\",\n    \"refreshToken\": \"eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9...\",\n    \"tokenType\": \"Bearer\",\n    \"expiresIn\": 86400000,\n    \"user\": {\n      \"id\": \"a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890\",\n      \"email\": \"newuser@example.com\",\n      \"role\": \"USER\",\n      \"leadCredits\": 25\n    }\n  },\n  \"message\": \"Registration successful\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-28T10:30:00Z\"\n}",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"newuser@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"SecurePass123!\"\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/register",
                  "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "register"]
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "409 Conflict \u2014 Email Already Exists",
              "status": "Conflict",
              "code": 409,
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"status\": \"error\",\n  \"error\": {\n    \"code\": \"EMAIL_ALREADY_EXISTS\",\n    \"message\": \"Email already registered\",\n    \"details\": { \"field\": \"email\" }\n  },\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-28T10:30:00Z\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "400 Bad Request \u2014 Validation Error",
              "status": "Bad Request",
              "code": 400,
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"status\": \"error\",\n  \"error\": {\n    \"code\": \"VALIDATION_ERROR\",\n    \"message\": \"Request validation failed\",\n    \"details\": {\n      \"email\": \"Invalid email format\",\n      \"password\": \"Password must be between 8 and 100 characters\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-28T10:30:00Z\"\n}"
            }
          ],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "// Auto-set token and user info from registration response",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (jsonData.data) {",
                  "        pm.environment.set('token', jsonData.data.token);",
                  "        pm.environment.set('refresh_token', jsonData.data.refreshToken);",
                  "        pm.environment.set('user_id', jsonData.data.user.id);",
                  "        console.log('Registration successful. Token auto-set.');",
                  "    }",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "\uD83D\uDD11 Login",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"user@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"SecurePass123!\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Authenticate with email and password.\n\nReturns JWT access token + refresh token. Access token expires in 24 hours (configurable).\n\n**Rate Limit:** 10 requests/minute/IP"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK \u2014 Login Successful",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"status\": \"success\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"token\": \"eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9...\",\n    \"refreshToken\": \"eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9...\",\n    \"tokenType\": \"Bearer\",\n    \"expiresIn\": 86400000,\n    \"user\": {\n      \"id\": \"a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890\",\n      \"email\": \"user@example.com\",\n      \"role\": \"USER\",\n      \"leadCredits\": 25\n    }\n  },\n  \"message\": \"Login successful\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-28T10:30:00Z\"\n}",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"user@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"SecurePass123!\"\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/login",
                  "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login"]
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "401 Unauthorized \u2014 Invalid Credentials",
              "status": "Unauthorized",
              "code": 401,
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"status\": \"error\",\n  \"error\": {\n    \"code\": \"INVALID_CREDENTIALS\",\n    \"message\": \"Invalid email or password\"\n  },\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-28T10:30:00Z\"\n}"
            }
          ],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "// Auto-set token and user info from login response",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (jsonData.data) {",
                  "        pm.environment.set('token', jsonData.data.token);",
                  "        pm.environment.set('refresh_token', jsonData.data.refreshToken);",
                  "        pm.environment.set('user_id', jsonData.data.user.id);",
                  "        console.log('Login successful. Token auto-set.');",
                  "    }",
                  "} else {",
                  "    console.error('Login failed:', pm.response.text());",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "\uD83D\uDD04 Refresh Token",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refresh_token}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/refresh",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "refresh"]
            },
            "description": "Issue a new access token using a valid refresh token.\n\n**Token Rotation:** The old refresh token is revoked and a new one is issued. If a revoked token is reused, ALL tokens for that user are invalidated (theft protection)."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK \u2014 Tokens Rotated",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"status\": \"success\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"token\": \"eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9...\",\n    \"refreshToken\": \"eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9...\",\n    \"tokenType\": \"Bearer\",\n    \"expiresIn\": 86400000,\n    \"user\": {\n      \"id\": \"a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890\",\n      \"email\": \"user@example.com\",\n      \"role\": \"USER\",\n      \"leadCredits\": 25\n    }\n  },\n  \"message\": \"Token refreshed successfully\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-28T10:30:00Z\"\n}",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refresh_token}}\"\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/refresh",
                  "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "refresh"]
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "401 Unauthorized \u2014 Token Expired / Revoked",
              "status": "Unauthorized",
              "code": 401,
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"status\": \"error\",\n  \"error\": {\n    \"code\": \"REFRESH_TOKEN_EXPIRED\",\n    \"message\": \"Refresh token has expired. Please login again.\"\n  },\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-28T10:30:00Z\"\n}"
            }
          ],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "// Update tokens after refresh",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (jsonData.data) {",
                  "        pm.environment.set('token', jsonData.data.token);",
                  "        pm.environment.set('refresh_token', jsonData.data.refreshToken);",
                  "        console.log('Tokens refreshed successfully.');",
                  "    }",
                  "} else {",
                  "    console.error('Refresh failed:', pm.response.text());",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "\uD83D\uDEAA Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": ""
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/logout",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "logout"]
            },
            "description": "Invalidate all active sessions.\n\n**What happens:**\n1. All refresh tokens for this user are revoked in the database\n2. The current access token is blacklisted in Redis\n3. Both tokens become immediately unusable\n\n**Note:** Logout requires a valid JWT in the `Authorization` header. Run **Login** first to set the token."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "204 No Content \u2014 Logout Successful",
              "status": "No Content",
              "code": 204,
              "header": [],
              "body": "",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" },
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/logout",
                  "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "logout"]
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "401 Unauthorized \u2014 Missing / Invalid Token",
              "status": "Unauthorized",
              "code": 401,
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"status\": \"error\",\n  \"error\": {\n    \"code\": \"UNAUTHORIZED\",\n    \"message\": \"Authentication is required to access this resource\"\n  },\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-28T10:30:00Z\"\n}"
            }
          ],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "// Clear token variables on successful logout",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 204) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set('token', '');",
                  "    pm.environment.set('refresh_token', '');",
                  "    pm.environment.set('user_id', '');",
                  "    console.log('Logout successful. Tokens cleared.');",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "\uD83D\uDC64 User APIs",
      "description": "User profile management endpoints \u2014 requires JWT authentication.\n\nThese endpoints are proxied through the API Gateway to the card-service.",
      "item": [
