              "path": ["api", "v1", "cards", "me"]
            },
            "description": "Retrieve the authenticated user's card profile.\n\n**Headers:**\n- `Authorization: Bearer {{token}}` \u2014 JWT access token\n\nThe X-User-Id header is injected automatically by the API Gateway after JWT validation."
